{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2021-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1630454400, "end_date": 1631059199, "month_true_total": 1711, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:02:22 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "98961628", "author": {"steamid": "76561198403730506", "personaname": "MiguelMac223", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198403730506/", "num_games_owned": 63, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1164, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 373, "last_played": 1645153672, "avatar": "3ee699e03a4fdbc90a16718a36ba5e24a3f64d59"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1631056838, "timestamp_updated": 1631056838, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98960256", "author": {"steamid": "76561198134220884", "personaname": "John Buckler", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/JohnBuckler/", "num_games_owned": 723, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 20490, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15950, "last_played": 1743283311, "avatar": "ef0d6164797eede6939078c018f9baa23cb08605"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game though still very dependant on platinum (premium currency).", "timestamp_created": 1631054419, "timestamp_updated": 1631054419, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98960067", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069664373", "personaname": "Silent Resolve", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/silent_resolve/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 69131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 66594, "last_played": 1663188188, "avatar": "21464058ac78a9e3cad2943fbc11a20f77b057fb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is a fast pasted, somewhat tactical, looter-shooter. It can be played slowly and tactically when you need to but it leans more on speed and damage. Although Digital Extremes has already finished a step in re-balancing some weapons.\n\nThe range and recoil stats are a mystery. With some mods not showing or giving any clue to how effective their upgrades are. You are locked out of gaining or regaining Flawed Mods once the tutorial quests are complete. So no complete collections unless you help some people out.\n\nAnother aspect of this game are stealth missions and missions you can accomplish through stealth.\nBecause of this, a silenced machine-gun or combat rifle can work wonders if caught.\nJust take the enemy down before they start the alarms, and hide.", "timestamp_created": 1631054100, "timestamp_updated": 1631054100, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98958174", "author": {"steamid": "76561198183841727", "personaname": "ToucanToken", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/toucantoken/", "num_games_owned": 270, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 7595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 355, "last_played": 1785896925, "avatar": "ff137987fcdb509af80a1f11ff3c9281d51f13de"}, "language": "english", "review": "My steam time doesn't show the real number of hours I've put into this, but Warframe is amazing. The best example of how free-to-play should be done. You don't need to pay anything to get everything in this game. It takes time, a lot of it, but paying money won't get you too far lol. Only a handful of cosmetics are prime only.\n\nThis game will suck all your time up though. That's the only cost ;-;", "timestamp_created": 1631050785, "timestamp_updated": 1631050785, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98958127", "author": {"steamid": "76561198403513553", "personaname": "notfused", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198403513553/", "num_games_owned": 19, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 3029, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2539, "last_played": 1631214543, "avatar": "3792bb37c900c6fb2e27e4f4d3dab40451319d21"}, "language": "english", "review": "wow", "timestamp_created": 1631050710, "timestamp_updated": 1631050710, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}